{%- comment -%}
===============================================================================
  Turn2Opinion — email system v1 ("the conversation")
  -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Template   : 15. New ticket — team
  File       : ticket-created-team.liquid
  Class      : Support (transactional — no unsubscribe)
  Trigger    : Internal: a member opened a support ticket
  Tone       : night
  Replaces   : ticket-created-team.liquid

  SUBJECT LINES — pick one, or A/B them
    1. New ticket {{ data.ticketNo }}: {{ data.subject }}
    2. [T2O] New ticket {{ data.ticketNo }} from {{ user.name }}
    3. Turn2Opinion support — new ticket {{ data.ticketNo }}

  PREHEADER
    Open, awaiting first response. Member details inside.

  PRIMARY CTA
    none — this template asks for nothing

  PLAIN-TEXT ALTERNATIVE
    dist/text/ticket-created-team.txt — send as the text/plain part of a multipart message.
    HTML-only mail is scored down by most spam filters.

  Generated from react/src/emails/15-ticket-created-team.jsx — edit the JSX and re-run
  `npm run build`. Hand edits to this file are overwritten.

  Images are served from the base configured at build time; upload assets/
  there before sending. Serve over HTTPS from a stable path — clients do not
  retry a 404, so a moved asset breaks every copy already delivered.
===============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}
